Package: lcamate
Type: Package
Title: Matrix-Based Life Cycle Assessment in R
Version: 0.0.0.9031
Authors@R: person("Juan C.", "Gaviria-Chaverra", email = "jcarlos.gaviria@udea.edu.co",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-9403-416X"))
Description: Computes life cycle assessment (LCA) results with the matrix
    method of ISO 14044: technosphere and biosphere matrices are built from
    a table of exchanges, the supply vector is obtained by solving a sparse
    linear system, and inventories, impact scores and process contributions
    follow from it. Monte Carlo simulation with lognormal uncertainty is
    included. Results are validated against Brightway and openLCA. 'LCA' here means
    life cycle assessment, not latent class analysis.
